{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542520/extras/6e98a6ea696a3fd3737a3372599e10cd.avif?t=1754832104\" width=1280 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A science fiction visual novel about a scientist who was invited to a mysterious project. To conduct research in a deep mine. But at some point, the secrets of a corporation that secretly does terrible things are revealed. We have to uncover a conspiracy and warn humanity about the impending threat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542520/extras/2a148899a36c8b0186ff8a7416ec23d6.avif?t=1754832104\" width=1600 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542520/extras/56975992595e5b5fccac16e89a28cf62.poster.avif?t=1754832104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542520/extras/56975992595e5b5fccac16e89a28cf62.webm?t=1754832104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542520/extras/56975992595e5b5fccac16e89a28cf62.mp4?t=1754832104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues that will allow you to learn more about the world and secrets of the corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542520/extras/89c112a46eaaa2def4284be5b5425a73.avif?t=1754832104\" width=1600 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht